This project drives Keysight instruments but contains no Keysight code. The
B1500A FLEX command set and the B1530A WGFMU library are used through their
published interfaces and cited by document and page number; no part of any
Keysight manual is redistributed here. Obtain those manuals from Keysight.

THE SOFTWARE CONTROLS LABORATORY INSTRUMENTS THAT CAN APPLY VOLTAGE AND
CURRENT TO A PHYSICAL DEVICE. The software limits in this program are
convenience guards, not instrument ratings and not a safety system. Whoever
runs it is responsible for the wiring, the limits and the device under test.
